      "side": 1,
      "message": "This 5-thread pool is created in the `@Activate` constructor but never shut down, and the component has no `@Deactivate` method. Each bundle restart or component reactivation leaks 5 non-daemon threads.\n\nSuggest adding:\n\n```\n@Deactivate\npublic void close() {\n   executor.shutdown();\n}\n```",
      "revId": "7ff1b270f9d9597a5e84568d547bb27b32490f51",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
