      "side": 1,
      "message": "Global mutable state. The singleton aggregator and the static `isSecondStepHybrid/npathorder` in `PathComputationServiceImpl` are shared across the 5-thread executor, so concurrent requests overwrite each other. \n\n`resetInstance()` is also called inside the per-k loop, which wipes the previous k\u0027s results.",
      "revId": "7ff1b270f9d9597a5e84568d547bb27b32490f51",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
