      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T13:37:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This branch can never run. The if at line 167 already takes every path where !isPathHybrid(path, allPceNodes) is true, so this else if is never reached, whatever isSecondStepHybridPC is. As it stands, the step-2 logic is dead code.\n\nAlso, isPathHybrid has side effects: it appends to pathElementList and crossDomainServiceBldr. Calling it twice adds those entries twice for every hybrid path.\n\nI suggest calling it once and storing the result. Then check isSecondStepHybridPC first, for example:\n\n```\nI suggest calling it once and storing the result. Then check isSecondStepHybridPC first, for example:\nboolean hybrid \u003d isPathHybrid(path, allPceNodes);\nif (!hybrid \u0026\u0026 isSecondStepHybridPC) {\n   // step 2\n} else if (!hybrid) {\n   // regular\n} else {\n   // hybrid\n}\n```",
      "revId": "7ff1b270f9d9597a5e84568d547bb27b32490f51",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
