      "message": "The successor ternaries are backwards, and the edge index is off by one: the next edge should be `edges.get(highIndex)`, not `highIndex + 1`.\n\nThe last sub-path throws an IOOBE, and middle sub-paths get a null successor.",
      "revId": "7ff1b270f9d9597a5e84568d547bb27b32490f51",
